ploratory role context uses the ordered RIASEC profile RIC: the course-linked work involves map the starting water, settled particles, transferred liquid and filter output; show which observations support each change; check a seller claim against evidence. The mapping is provisional until career-domain review.', 'Preferred', 'B.Tech. Civil Engineering; B.Tech. Chemical Engineering; B.Tech. Environmental Engineering', 'RIC', '{"verbal_reasoning": 64, "logical_reasoning": 86, "numerical_reasoning": 88, "data_interpretation": 82, "pattern_recognition": 75, "spatial_reasoning": 85}'::jsonb, '{"openness": 5, "conscientiousness": 5, "extraversion": 3, "agreeableness": 3, "emotional_stability": 4}'::jsonb, '{"impact": 5, "status": 4, "autonomy": 4, "security": 4, "financial": 4, "lifestyle": 3, "creativity": 5, "leadership": 4}'::jsonb, '{"areas": ["Spatial Reasoning", "Logical Reasoning", "Data Interpretation"], "rationale": "These are suggested role-demand areas for Water Plant Designer, based on map the starting water, settled particles, transferred liquid and filter output; show which observations support each change; check a seller claim against evidence. They require subject-matter review before assessment matching."}'::jsonb, '{"traits": ["Conscientiousness", "Openness", "Emotional Stability"], "rationale": "These traits may support the work of Water Plant Designer, especially draw or label jar a to jar b to cup c flow; compare what a paper filter can and cannot remove; identify missing evidence before planning improvements. This is a role hypothesis, not an assessment of a learner."}'::jsonb, '{"values": ["Creativity", "Impact", "Security"], "rationale": "This exploratory pathway may appeal to learners who value creativity, impact, security. Individual interest must come from the learner''s assessment, not the course."}'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET "role_family_domain_id"=EXCLUDED."role_family_domain_id", "role_id"=EXCLUDED."role_id", "description"=EXCLU